@startuml sx1262_spi_transport_states
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Locked : write/read [lock obtenido]
Idle --> LockError : write/read [lock timeout]
Locked --> WaitReady : iniciar deadline
WaitReady --> WaitReady : BUSY / sleep 1 ms
WaitReady --> Transfer : !BUSY
WaitReady --> BusyError : deadline vencido
Transfer --> IoError : transfer fallo
Transfer --> WaitComplete : escritura exitosa
Transfer --> Unlock : lectura exitosa / copiar datos
WaitComplete --> WaitComplete : BUSY / sleep 1 ms
WaitComplete --> Unlock : !BUSY
WaitComplete --> BusyError : deadline vencido
BusyError --> Unlock
IoError --> Unlock
Unlock --> Idle : liberar mutex / retornar resultado
LockError --> Idle : retornar LOCK_TIMEOUT

note right of Idle
  Estado estable entre operaciones.
  Cada llamada recorre la maquina
  de forma sincronica.
end note
@enduml
